{"ref":"BDB, עֵר","hw":"עֵר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Hρ <strong>(</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עוּר\" href=\"/BDB,_עוּר\", dir=\"rtl\">עוּר</a> Qal Pt.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  eldest son of Judah <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:3\" href=\"/Genesis.38.3\">Gn 38:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:6\" href=\"/Genesis.38.6\">6</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.3\">1 Ch 2:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:7\" href=\"/Genesis.38.7\">Gn 38:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:12\" href=\"/Genesis.46.12\">46:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:19\" href=\"/Numbers.26.19\">Nu 26:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Judah’s son Shelah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.21\">1 Ch 4:21</a>.—Vid. also <strong>Qal</strong> Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵר</span> supr.","next":"BDB, עֵרִי","prev":"BDB, עִיר"}